SERVATIONS_NOT_REQUIRED"],"不需要訂位",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwifmen_zNKWAxWlh68BHctmHxcQ3YcHCKIBKAA"]],1],null,null,"預訂網址",null,"0ahUKEwifmen_zNKWAxWlh68BHctmHxcQ3IcHCKEBKBE",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["整體內用體驗不錯，採用 QR Code 點餐，流程順暢也方便\n\n咖哩表現屬於連鎖店該有的穩定水準，不會有太大落差。這次點了菜單推薦的炸豬排咖哩，外酥內嫩，搭配咖哩很順口，是安全不踩雷的選擇\n\n另外加點甜點有半價優惠，香草冰淇淋搭配咖啡，香氣濃郁、甜度適中，算是有加分的小驚喜\n\n不過在加點配料或升級套餐後，整體價格會明顯往上拉，CP值就比較見仁見智。\n\n整體來說：\n適合想吃穩定品質咖哩、用餐環境舒適的人，但如果追求高CP值，點餐時建議稍微控制加點項目",null,[0,94]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/89806622423372353/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhhY2xKcE1EVmpSbWhFWkZab1RWVlhOVlpoYVRGRVZIcEdkVTF1WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/89806622423372353/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhhY2xKcE1EVmpSbWhFWkZab1RWVlhOVlpoYVRGRVZIcEdkVTF1WXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/89806622423372353/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhhY2xKcE1EVmpSbWhFWkZab1RWVlhOVlpoYVRGRVZIcEdkVTF1WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/89806622423372353/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhhY2xKcE1EVmpSbWhFWkZab1RWVlhOVlpoYVRGRVZIcEdkVTF1WXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/89806622423372353/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhhY2xKcE1EVmpSbWhFWkZab1RWVlhOVlpoYVRGRVZIcEdkVTF1WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/89806622423372353/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhhY2xKcE1EVmpSbWhFWkZab1RWVlhOVlpoYVRGRVZIcEdkVTF1WXhBQhAA"]],[null,null,737,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xaclJpMDVjRmhEZFZoTVVXNVZhaTFEVHpGdU1uYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xa457b12f8d542a76!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOlZrRi05cFhDdVhMUW5Vai1DTzFuMnc%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNv